<body><p>Dear $name,</p><br/>

<p>We would like to inform you that your account has been activated.</p>

<p>Your user name: $userName.</p>

<p>Your password: &lt;encrypted&gt; (hidden for security reasons)</p>

<p>In order to access your account please <a href="$HOST">click here</a><br/>
    (or copy/paste and go to following link in your web browser: $HOST</p>


<p>Thank you for your interest in our product.</p>

</body>
</html>